Subject: Libretro dual: single-pak link, the 2P GBA boots without a cartridge from the real BIOS (mgba_dual_p2_nocart)
Series-Step: 19/19 (mgba_dual 1.6-os4)
Origin: hanbang (this project)
요약: 1.6 싱글팩 — 게임별 옵션 mgba_dual_p2_nocart=enabled 이면 2P 게임기를 팩 없이 진짜 바이오스로 켜서, 방장(1P)의 멀티부트 프로그램을 받게 함(봄버맨 스토리 · 매지컬 퀘스트 · 샨테). 옵션이 꺼져 있으면(기본) 1.5 와 바이트까지 같음.

With the per-game core option mgba_dual_p2_nocart = enabled (read at load, link on, BIOS available) the 2P GBA is
created without a ROM: the BIOS is loaded first, the cartridge area is an open bus, no save chip (FORCE_NONE), and the
BIOS waits for the multiboot signal (0x6200) of player 1 as on a real console. If the BIOS cannot be used (file missing,
use_bios off) the 2P GBA runs from the pack as before and a log line says so. The state version field gets
DUAL_STATE_NOCART16 only for a no-cartridge 2P; 1.5 and older refuse it. The guest sends no save (only an ACK), the
.p2.srm slot is not read or written, and the guest core binds to no exchange. With the option off the behaviour is
byte-identical to 1.5. Version string 1.6-os4.

